  "body": "• Exclusive Boutique Development: Three brand-new, standalone freehold homes (44A, 44B & 44C Braemar Road) in prime Rothesay Bay\r\n•  Elevated Coastal Views: Thoughtfully designed split-level layouts capturing natural sunlight and stunning sea views\r\n•  Versatile Accommodation: 4 bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms configured for family flexibility\r\n•  Multiple Living Zones: Expansive open-plan living, designer kitchens, and dedicated second lounges flowing to sunny balconies\r\n•  Superior Build Quality: Durable weatherboard and fibre-cement cladding, double glazing, and premium finishes throughout\r\n•  Garaging & Extra Parking: Double internal-access garages, dedicated laundry spaces, plus off-street parking for each property\r\n•  Coastal Lifestyle Location: Short distance to Rothesay Bay beach, coastal reserves, local cafés, and boutique shops\r\n•  Top-Tier Education: Zoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Browns Bay Primary School\r\n\r\nIntroducing an exceptional opportunity to secure a brand-new, premium home in one of the North Shore’s most coveted coastal enclaves. 44 Braemar Road presents a boutique collection of three beautifully crafted, standalone freehold residences, each designed to deliver contemporary luxury, low-maintenance living, and supreme versatility.\r\n\r\nSet in a peaceful, highly desirable street, the development offers three unique options to suit your family’s needs:\r\n• 44A Braemar Road: Elevated front position on a 207m² (mol) freehold section featuring 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and expansive open-plan living with sea views.\r\n• 44B Braemar Road: Quiet central position on a 221m² (mol) freehold section featuring 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and dual living zones.\r\n• 44C Braemar Road: Private rear position on a 275m² (mol) freehold section featuring 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and an innovative reversed living layout.\r\n\r\nConstructed for complete peace of mind, all three residences offer solid weatherboard construction, double glazing, high-end fixtures, and the complete independence of standalone freehold titles.\r\n\r\nThe location delivers the ultimate coastal lifestyle, being a short distance to Rothesay Bay beach, coastal tracks, and local cafés, while securing an elite education for your family in top school zones.\r\n\r\nWhether you prefer front-row elevated sea views, spacious master suites, or dual living areas, this outstanding new development offers a home to suit your exact needs. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing of all three residences - your dream Rothesay Bay lifestyle awaits.",
